---
import RitualExperience from '../../../layouts/RitualExperience.astro';
import { ritualExperiences } from '../../../data/ritualExperiences';

const fireRitual = ritualExperiences.fire;
const imageBase = '/images/digital-rituals/step-into-the-fire';
---

<RitualExperience
  title="Step Into Your Fire | My Ritual Library"
  description="A private ceremonial journey within the Tarot Flower Ritual Library."
  image={fireRitual.image}
>
  <main class="fire-ritual-experience digital-ritual-page--fire" data-ritual-experience data-product-slug="step-into-your-fire">
    <div class="fire-ritual-loading" data-ritual-loading>
      <span class="fire-ritual-ember" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Opening the ritual…</p>
    </div>

    <article class="fire-ritual-page" data-ritual-content hidden>
      <header class="fire-ritual-opening">
        <img
          class="fire-ritual-opening-image"
          src={fireRitual.image}
          width={fireRitual.width}
          height={fireRitual.height}
          alt={fireRitual.imageAlt}
        />
        <div class="fire-ritual-opening-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <a class="fire-ritual-library-link" href="/library/">My Ritual Library</a>
        <div class="fire-ritual-opening-copy">
          <p class="fire-ritual-eyebrow">STEP INTO YOUR FIRE</p>
          <h1>Welcome,<br />Warrior Goddess.</h1>
          <p class="fire-ritual-opening-answer">You answered the call.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-sacred-law" aria-labelledby="sacred-law-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row fire-sacred-law-composition">
          <p class="fire-ritual-eyebrow">WHITE MAGIC · DO NO HARM</p>
          <h2 id="sacred-law-title">THE SACRED LAW</h2>
          <p class="fire-sacred-law-opening">Don't underestimate your magic.</p>
          <p class="fire-sacred-law-power">Our intentions are powerful.</p>
          <div class="fire-sacred-law-return">
            <p>The law of threefold return is simple: whatever energy you put into the world shall come back to you threefold.</p>
            <p>If you bring love, abundance, mercy, forgiveness, joy, gratitude—it shall come back to you threefold.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-sacred-law-shadow">
            <p>Sometimes we carry anger, resentment, rage, or other negative energies that may be just and righteous. We can bring those shadows to the altar. We can sacrifice them. We can release them.</p>
            <p class="fire-sacred-law-not-intention">But they are not our intention.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="fire-sacred-law-altar">We approach the altar in purity and love.</p>
          <p class="fire-sacred-law-sacrifice">At the threshold, we offer a sacrifice. But it is a sacrifice of something that we no longer wish to carry. A sacrifice we make for the benefit of ourselves and others.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-ancient-remembrance" aria-labelledby="ancient-remembrance-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-wide-row fire-ancient-grid">
          <figure class="fire-ritual-art fire-ancient-art">
            <img src={`${imageBase}/fire-goddess-front-flipped.jpg`} width="1050" height="1500" alt="Fire goddess oracle artwork" loading="lazy" />
          </figure>
          <div class="fire-ancient-copy">
            <h2 id="ancient-remembrance-title">ANCIENT REMEMBRANCE</h2>
            <p>I'm sharing my practice with you as a guide—to inspire you, awaken what you already know, and help you discover your own.</p>
            <p>Listen to your soul. Trust your intuition. If you feel inspired to do something differently, follow what arises.</p>
            <p class="fire-ancient-knowing">You already know how to practice magic.</p>
            <p class="fire-ancient-yours">Your magic is yours.</p>
            <p class="fire-ancient-sovereign">YOU ARE SOVEREIGN.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-radical-honesty" aria-labelledby="radical-honesty-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row fire-radical-composition">
          <h2 id="radical-honesty-title">RADICAL HONESTY</h2>
          <p class="fire-radical-surrender">Beautiful Surrender</p>
          <p class="fire-radical-intro">This ritual asks for radical honesty.</p>
          <p>Nobody else needs to know what you write. Nobody is watching. This is your sacred space.</p>
          <p class="fire-radical-depth">Go as deep as you're willing to go.</p>
          <p class="fire-radical-power">The deeper you go, the more powerful the magic becomes.</p>
          <p class="fire-radical-command">Be honest with yourself.</p>
          <p class="fire-radical-release">And then surrender.</p>
          <p class="fire-radical-closing">We sacrifice what we no longer wish to carry. We release it without trying to control the outcome.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-prepare" aria-labelledby="prepare-ritual-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row fire-prepare-introduction">
          <h2 id="prepare-ritual-title">PREPARE YOUR RITUAL</h2>
          <p class="fire-prepare-lede">Set aside at least one uninterrupted hour for yourself.</p>
          <p>Once we <strong>CREATE THE CIRCLE</strong>, we will move through the complete ritual together before <strong>OPENING IT AGAIN.</strong></p>
          <p>Give yourself enough time to prepare your space, move through the ritual without rushing, and return gently when it's complete.</p>
          <p class="fire-prepare-protect">Turn off your phone. Close the door. Protect this time.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fire-ritual-wide-row fire-altar-grid">
          <figure class="fire-ritual-art fire-altar-art">
            <img src={`${imageBase}/destruction-video-thumbnail.jpg`} width="1920" height="1080" alt="Vanessa's ritual altar with candles and a smoking copalera" loading="lazy" />
          </figure>
          <div class="fire-altar-copy">
            <p class="fire-ritual-eyebrow">THE ALTAR OF YOUR SACRED BECOMING</p>
            <h3>At the center of your circle, create something beautiful.</h3>
            <p>This is the sacred center of the ritual: an altar to your sacred becoming, your power, your fire, and the divine feminine within you.</p>
            <p>When the ritual begins, we will walk the circle three times, cleansing the energy and creating sacred space around the altar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="fire-ritual-row fire-materials">
          <div class="fire-materials-group">
            <h3>WHAT YOU'LL NEED</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Your ritual companion or journal</li>
              <li>A pen</li>
              <li>A candle and something to light it</li>
              <li>A fireproof bowl, cauldron, copalera, large ashtray, or other appropriate fireproof vessel</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-materials-group fire-materials-optional">
            <h3>OPTIONAL</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Incense</li>
              <li>Sage</li>
              <li>Palo Santo</li>
              <li>Copal</li>
              <li>Anything else you love for cleansing your circle</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p class="fire-materials-space">You also need enough physical space to move freely during the ritual.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-let-us-begin" aria-labelledby="let-us-begin-title">
        <div class="fire-threshold-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="fire-ritual-row fire-threshold-copy">
          <h2 id="let-us-begin-title">LET US BEGIN</h2>
          <div class="fire-threshold-preparation">
            <p>Choose the space where you will practice.</p>
            <p>Gather what you need and create your Altar of Sacred Becoming at the center of your circle.</p>
            <p>Take a moment to become still.</p>
            <p>Bring your focus inward.</p>
            <p>Remember your sovereignty and the spirit in which you enter this ritual.</p>
            <p>Keep your companion or journal and a pen beside you.</p>
            <p>When I invite you to write, return to it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="fire-threshold-map" aria-labelledby="four-thresholds-title">
            <h3 id="four-thresholds-title">THE FOUR THRESHOLDS</h3>
            <ol>
              <li><strong>INITIATION</strong><span>I Choose</span></li>
              <li><strong>DESTRUCTION</strong><span>I Release</span></li>
              <li><strong>GUARDIAN</strong><span>I Embody</span></li>
              <li><strong>FREEDOM</strong><span>I Receive</span></li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <button class="fire-press-play" type="button" data-video-cta aria-controls="complete-ritual-video">
            <span>WHEN YOU'RE READY,</span>
            <strong>PRESS PLAY.</strong>
          </button>
          <p class="fire-inner-fire">Let's ignite the fire—our inner fire.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-video-section" aria-label="Final unified ritual video">
        <div class="fire-ritual-wide-row">
          <div id="complete-ritual-video" class="fire-unified-video-placeholder" tabindex="-1" data-unified-video-target>
            <span class="fire-video-play-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <p>FINAL UNIFIED STEP INTO YOUR FIRE RITUAL VIDEO</p>
            <small>VIDEO PLACEHOLDER</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-blessing" aria-labelledby="blessing-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row fire-blessing-composition">
          <h2 id="blessing-title">YOUR BLESSING</h2>
          <div class="fire-blessing-text">
            <p>I left my shadow behind at the altar of destruction.</p>
            <p>It burned away to make space for the light.</p>
            <p>And I grow my fire, my flame, my guardian.</p>
            <p>I am my guardian.</p>
            <p>I stand tall, I stand proud.</p>
            <p>I am, I walk, I fight, I guide, I burn, I bring the light.</p>
            <p>Charge forward with your light.</p>
            <p>Leave the ashes behind.</p>
            <p>Rise up and shine.</p>
            <p>The ancient remembrance be your guide.</p>
            <p>You rise.</p>
            <p>You are between worlds.</p>
            <p>You walk between worlds.</p>
            <p>You walk, you fly.</p>
            <p>Carry the fire forward with you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-open-circle" aria-labelledby="open-circle-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row">
          <h2 id="open-circle-title">OPEN THE CIRCLE</h2>
          <p>Walk your circle three times in reverse.</p>
          <p>With each revolution, offer gratitude for what you have released, what you have received, and your own sacred becoming.</p>
          <p class="fire-circle-open">The circle is open.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-reflections" aria-labelledby="reflections-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row">
          <h2 id="reflections-title">REFLECTIONS &amp; MESSAGES</h2>
          <div class="fire-reflections-introduction">
            <p>Keep this journal beside you.</p>
            <p>The ritual may continue to speak through dreams, feelings, memories, insights, or messages.</p>
            <p>When something comes, write it down.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fire-reflection-whispers" aria-label="Reflection questions">
            <p>What did you see?</p>
            <p>What did you feel?</p>
            <p>What did you remember?</p>
            <p>What did you dream of?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-downloads" aria-labelledby="downloads-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row">
          <h2 id="downloads-title">DOWNLOADS</h2>
          <div class="fire-download-links">
            <a class="fire-download-link" href="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/guide?download=1">DOWNLOAD RITUAL COMPANION</a>
            <span class="fire-download-link is-pending" aria-disabled="true">
              DOWNLOAD VIDEO
              <small>FINAL UNIFIED VIDEO PENDING</small>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fire-ritual-section fire-continuation" aria-labelledby="continuation-title">
        <div class="fire-ritual-row">
          <h2 id="continuation-title">CONTINUE THE SACRED BECOMING</h2>
          <nav class="fire-continuation-links" aria-label="Continue the Sacred Becoming">
            <a href="/shop/#shop-coming-soon-title">Sacred Becoming Oracle Deck</a>
            <a href="/rituals/"><strong>Elemental Rituals</strong><span>Fire · Water · Earth · Air · Aether</span></a>
            <a href="/sacred-becoming/mentorship/">Sacred Becoming Mentorship</a>
            <a href="/goddess-yoga-retreats/">Goddess Yoga Retreats</a>
            <a href="/readings-with-vanessa/">Tarot Readings</a>
            <a href="/goddess-embodiment-practices/">Vanessa Hylande</a>
          </nav>
          <a class="fire-return-library" href="/library/">Return to My Ritual Library</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>

    <section class="fire-ritual-access-error" hidden data-ritual-error>
      <p class="fire-ritual-eyebrow">PRIVATE RITUAL</p>
      <h1>This ritual isn’t available in the current library session.</h1>
      <a class="digital-ritual-button" href="/library/login/">Email My Magic Link</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/scripts/fire-ritual-page.js" is:inline></script>
</RitualExperience>
